# 🔑 4. ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES & SENSITIVE SECRETS
# Blocks plain secrets from ever being tracked in your local tree history
.env
.env.*
*.local

# Whitelist your boilerplate file so the AI/team knows the structure
!.env.example

# 🖥️ 5. OPERATING SYSTEM ARTIFACTS
# Prevents binary junk allocations from polluting cross-platform repos
DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini